OL,3,GNEWSASouth falls silent on Remembrance
OL,4,ASunday
OL,5,
OL,6,FCommunities across the south of England
OL,7,Fhave fallen silent to remember those
OL,8,Fwho died serving in the two world wars
OL,9,Fand other conflicts.
OL,11,FWreaths were laid at war memorials
OL,12,Facross the region, with services and
OL,13,Fparades including Dorchester, Poole,
OL,14,FBournemouth, Portsmouth, Winchester,
OL,15,FSouthampton and Newport on the Isle of
OL,16,FWight.
OL,18,FThousands of people also attended
OL,19,Fevents in Reading, Slough, Banbury,
OL,20,FOxford, Henley and Abingdon to watch
OL,21,Fparades, take part in services and pay
OL,22,Ftheir respects.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
